  "limitations": [
    "Direct original ae0 to PR fbee only; no incremental measurements are combined.",
    "Four AB/BA paired rounds plus one warmup per component. Cheap multicore sums three separately run components by global repetition; w12 has two requests per component. These are not continuous long searches or independent extra repeats.",
    "Matching includes planning shared with generation plus thread setup, generation, matching, scout witness selection and per-match JSON construction in the internal clock. Startup/query parsing and final whole-response serialization are outside it. CLI has its own internal search clock rounded to milliseconds.",
    "CLI equality is counts only. Matching compares full seed/recipe/ordered-witness records byte-for-byte within each job; equal query/input records across jobs are checked by canonical SHA-256/bytes/tested signatures. Different input ranges/counts are never equated.",
    "Full original records remain in supplied immutable archives/trees. Per-job manifest, EOF/teardown, source, compiler, frozen identity, and reviewed fail-fast runner checks must all pass. Non-compare build exits rely on the full successful worker receipt and pinned runner.",
    "Each job rebuilds and freezes its two variants; all frozen hashes are retained and are not assumed identical across independently built jobs.",
    "Worker counts use different literal input totals and do not establish fixed-N strong scaling. Four-case equal-weight geometric means do not describe the complete nine-case suite.",
